msgid "存储中断与读取接续"
msgstr "Storage interrupts and read continuations"

msgid "范围与接口"
msgstr "Scope and interfaces"

msgid ""
"NVMe 为 I/O CQ 申请 MSI-X entry 0，失败时尝试单消息 MSI；AHCI 使用 单消息 MSI。能力缺失或 PCI "
"向量预算耗尽时保留有界轮询。没有猜测共享 INTx 路由，也没有假定 AHCI 支持通用 MSI-X 端口映射。"
msgstr ""
"NVMe requests MSI-X entry 0 for its I/O CQ and falls back to single-"
"message MSI; AHCI uses single-message MSI. Missing capabilities or "
"exhausted PCI vectors retain bounded polling. Shared INTx routing and "
"generic AHCI MSI-X port mappings are not guessed."

msgid ""
"用户态继续使用原有 Linux syscall ABI 的 read/pread、write/pwrite、 fsync、mount "
"和模块管理接口。内部 -EAGAIN 由 syscall 返回路径重试， 不把硬件等待变成普通阻塞文件操作可见的 "
"EAGAIN。此处的“异步”指内核 读取接续，不表示已经实现 Linux AIO、io_uring 或新的 POSIX 接口。"
msgstr ""
"Userspace retains the existing Linux syscall ABI for read/pread, "
"write/pwrite, fsync, mount and module management. The syscall return path"
" retries internal -EAGAIN rather than exposing hardware waits as EAGAIN "
"from ordinary blocking file operations. Asynchronous here means a kernel "
"read continuation, not Linux AIO, io_uring or a new POSIX interface."

msgid "完成与等待"
msgstr "Completion and waiting"

msgid ""
"``block/core/storage_wait.c`` 持有永久存活的等待队列和完成代数。 syscall "
"在检查存储条件前取代数快照；驱动在返回 -EAGAIN 时提供命令的 绝对超时。所有驱动、transport "
"和文件系统调用栈退出后，syscall 尾部 才原子检查代数、链接任务并发布阻塞状态。先到的完成使代数变化，后到的 "
"完成唤醒已登记任务，因此不依赖下一次 PIT tick 恰好重新轮询。 无中断能力的设备仍使用一 tick 回退，硬件超时和信号仍可结束等待。"
msgstr ""
"``block/core/storage_wait.c`` owns a permanent wait queue and completion "
"generation. A syscall samples the generation before checking storage "
"conditions; a driver returning -EAGAIN supplies the command's absolute "
"timeout. Only after all driver, transport and filesystem call stacks "
"unwind does the syscall epilogue atomically check the generation, link "
"the task and publish its blocked state. Earlier completions change the "
"generation; later completions wake registered tasks, without relying on "
"another PIT polling tick. Devices without interrupts retain a one-tick "
"fallback; hardware timeouts and signals can still end the wait."

msgid ""
"锁顺序为 completion event lock、wait queue lock、scheduler lock。 NVMe 的短 "
"completion lock 与任务侧 controller lock 分离；IRQ 不取 controller、transport 或全局 "
"execution writer，不复制数据或恢复设备。 AHCI IRQ 在 W1C 前锁存端口状态，任务上下文同时检查实时及锁存错误， 避免 "
"TFES/主机总线错误在状态确认后丢失。"
msgstr ""
"The lock order is completion event lock, wait queue lock, then scheduler "
"lock. NVMe separates its short completion lock from the task-side "
"controller lock. IRQ handlers do not take the controller, transport or "
"global execution writer, copy data or recover devices. AHCI latches port "
"status before W1C; task context checks both live and latched errors so "
"acknowledgement cannot lose TFES or host-bus failures."

msgid "SMP、事务与 DMA"
msgstr "SMP, transactions and DMA"

msgid ""
"SMP 与单 CPU 使用相同的 execution writer 和磁盘事务 PID owner： "
"后续任务不能借用其他任务尚未完成的共享卷、缓存或 DMA 请求。重试重新 选择卷，后台内核 I/O 保存/恢复调用方的 replay "
"状态。此实现允许等待 设备时运行其他任务，并未取消文件系统共享状态的串行化。"
msgstr ""
"SMP and single-CPU operation share the execution writer and disk-"
"transaction PID owner. A later task cannot borrow another task's "
"unfinished volume, cache or DMA request. Retries reselect the volume; "
"background kernel I/O saves and restores the caller's replay state. Other"
" tasks can run while storage is pending; shared filesystem state remains "
"serialized."

msgid ""
"NVMe 当前仍为每控制器一个 I/O SQ/CQ、一个在途请求和独立于调用者 地址空间的 DMA/PRP backing。AHCI 仍使用串行 "
"pending 命令和各端口的 驱动 DMA。保存的 CPU 缓冲区指针只用于比较重试身份；完成拷贝只写当前 "
"调用提供的有效内存。请求变化时排空并丢弃旧结果，退出时取消/排空， 不会回写退出任务的旧指针。"
msgstr ""
"NVMe currently retains one I/O SQ/CQ and one outstanding request per "
"controller, with DMA/PRP backing independent of the caller's address "
"space. AHCI retains its serialized pending command and per-port driver "
"DMA. Saved CPU buffer pointers are only retry identities; completion "
"copies target only currently valid caller memory. A changed request "
"drains and discards old results; exit cancels/drains without writing "
"through retired task pointers."

msgid ""
"不可重放的写入、刷盘、启动及 reclaim/swap 路径保持同步。错误恢复先 证明控制器/端口 STOP，再重置队列或重用 DMA；STOP "
"失败保留 backing、 BAR 和模块。卸载先关闭新用户并禁用/排空 IRQ，再 STOP、释放资源。 没有在自旋锁或共享文件系统事务内保留 "
"C 栈休眠。"
msgstr ""
"Non-replayable writes, flushes, boot and reclaim/swap paths remain "
"synchronous. Recovery proves controller/port STOP before resetting queues"
" or reusing DMA. A failed STOP retains backing, BAR and module. Unload "
"first closes admission and disables/drains IRQs, then stops hardware and "
"releases resources. No C stack sleeps while holding a spinlock or shared "
"filesystem transaction."

msgid ""
"尚未实现多请求 NVMe 并行队列、AHCI NCQ、多队列亲和性，以及可释放 文件系统事务的异步写回。这些扩展需要每请求 DMA、独立完成状态和"
" 逐请求的引用/取消协议，不能仅增加 queue depth 或删除 owner 检查。"
msgstr ""
"Parallel multi-request NVMe queues, AHCI NCQ, multi-queue affinity and "
"asynchronous writeback that releases filesystem transactions are not "
"implemented. These require per-request DMA, independent completion state "
"and reference/cancellation protocols, not merely increased queue depth or"
" removal of owner checks."

msgid "验证"
msgstr "Verification"

msgid "ReliefNT 的宿主定向回归："
msgstr "Targeted ReliefNT host regressions:"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_nvme_dma.py``：PRP64、跨页、异步重试、CQ phase/CID、 旧缓冲区丢弃、取消和失败 STOP "
"保留。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_nvme_dma.py``: PRP64, page crossings, asynchronous retries, "
"CQ phase/CID, stale-buffer discard, cancellation and retention after "
"failed STOP."

msgid ""
"``tools/test_ahci_completion.py`` 与 ``tools/test_ahci_dma.py``：真实 "
"ATA/ATAPI/IDENTIFY 命令、DMA、W1C 后错误证据、取消与 STOP。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_ahci_completion.py`` and ``tools/test_ahci_dma.py``: real "
"ATA/ATAPI/IDENTIFY commands, DMA, error evidence after W1C, cancellation "
"and STOP."

msgid ""
"``tools/test_wait_queue_race.py``：完成先到/后到、任务唤醒、超时提示、 "
"轮询回退及等待链接清理；使用真实核心等待队列。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_wait_queue_race.py``: completion before/after registration, "
"task wakeup, timeout hints, polling fallback and wait-link cleanup using "
"the real core wait queue."

msgid "``tools/test_kthread.py``：后台上下文隔离和四 CPU 配置下竞争 PID owner。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_kthread.py``: background-context isolation and competing PID"
" owners in a four-CPU configuration."

msgid ""
"``tools/tests/storage_irq_guest.c`` 是针对真实 Linux/POSIX 用户态调用 "
"编译的原生探针。ReliefOS 的 ``tools/test_storage_irq_qemu.py`` 消费 本仓 install "
"manifest，创建私有 NVMe/AHCI ext4 磁盘，限速读取以触发 等待，并验证并发读写、fsync、终止读取、卸载重载后的内容及真实"
" MSI 计数；关机后由宿主 debugfs 再提取落盘文件并检查 SHA-256。限速用于 正确性验证，运行时间不能当成存储性能基准。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/tests/storage_irq_guest.c`` is a native probe compiled against "
"real Linux/POSIX userspace calls. ReliefOS's "
"``tools/test_storage_irq_qemu.py`` consumes this repository's install "
"manifest, creates private NVMe/AHCI ext4 disks, throttles reads to "
"trigger waiting, and checks concurrent reads/writes, fsync, reader "
"termination, content after unload/reload and real MSI counts. After "
"shutdown, host debugfs extracts the on-disk files for SHA-256 "
"verification. Throttling tests correctness; elapsed time is not a storage"
" performance benchmark."

msgid "VMware 验证未完成；真实 NVMe/SATA 硬件、长时间压力和故障注入也不由 QEMU 通过结果代替。"
msgstr ""
"VMware verification remains incomplete. Passing QEMU results do not "
"replace real NVMe/SATA hardware, extended stress or fault-injection "
"validation."
